+/* Caller supplies SHA256_CTX + SHA256_Init/Update/Final (native XNU:
+ * <libkern/crypto/sha2.h>). This is CPU-only preparation of exclusively
+ * owned, non-live extents. It does NOT authorize SMMU publication or MMIO.
